+ * DualSense and 64 on an Edge, no CRC anywhere. The MAX below is the larger of
+ * the two, the bound a write is refused for; the translation takes whatever
+ * length the presented descriptor declares, because the Bluetooth report it
+ * packs into is 78 bytes either way and only the number of trailing zeros
+ * changes. */
+#define DUALSENSE_USB_INPUT_ID     0x01
+#define DUALSENSE_USB_INPUT_LEN    64
+#define DUALSENSE_USB_OUTPUT_ID    0x02
+#define DUALSENSE_USB_OUTPUT_MAX   64
